    (leftProgsQ dt) (canonInvM gQ gsQ) (encode_canonInvM gQ gsQ) ?_ ?_ ?_
  · exact hdis_multi GrQ 0 1 dt leftDataQ (by decide) httQ hRvQ hLQ
  · exact hstep_assembled_multiF GrQ mvQ (FM gQ gsQ) envQ (leftProgsQ dt)
      hmvFQ hmvenvQ hfreshQ httQ hltQ (hframesQ dt)
      (HmultiQA dt hdt hv0 hv1)
  · exact hddF_multiE GrQ 0 1 dt leftDataQ (canonInvM gQ gsQ) domLQ domRQ
      (by decide) httQ hRvQ hLQ
      (canonInvM_varsL gQ gsQ (by
        intro g' hg'
        simp only [gQ, gsQ, List.mem_cons, List.not_mem_nil, or_false] at hg'
        rcases hg' with rfl | rfl <;> exact hgAt _))
      (canonInvM_varsR gQ gsQ) hdomLQ hdomRQ

